00:18:26.620 --> 00:18:33.620
<v Guest>to coordinate and work together as much as possible. You have to just take that with you.

195
00:18:34.320 --> 00:18:40.700
<v Guest>Look, we want to manufacture without a doubt, but we have to be also realistic

