198
00:18:54.760 --> 00:18:57.800
<v Guest>And it could be a very exciting place for all of us.

199
00:19:04.660 --> 00:19:12.440
<v Guest>One of the great things, Strive, I think about your experience, your career, is you started as an entrepreneur.

